WEBVTT

00:05:30.356 --> 00:05:32.476
And protecting tropical forests

00:05:32.516 --> 00:05:37.476
is one of the most cost-efficient ways
to avert climate disaster

00:05:37.476 --> 00:05:39.476
and biodiversity collapse.

00:05:40.116 --> 00:05:43.036
But the conservation world
needs an overhaul.

00:05:44.076 --> 00:05:47.236
We need more women
in the position of leadership --

00:05:47.876 --> 00:05:50.396
women from the grassroots,

00:05:50.436 --> 00:05:52.316
women like Sumini.

00:05:53.636 --> 00:05:57.356
Women make up half
of the world's population,

00:05:57.356 --> 00:06:01.396
yet only a fraction sits
at the decision-making table.